    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The model consists of three functional groups: the **prelude**, which embeds the input data into a latent space; the **core recurrent block**, which performs the iterative computations; and the **coda**, which un-embeds the final state and produces the output probabilities. The **recurrent block is iterated multiple times**, allowing the model to perform complex computations.",
